 Campaign maps and live servers introduce uncontrolled state; use a dedicated map or local server for comparison.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Download the free desktop release or server from an official source and pin the version.","Use a small custom map with fixed starting resources and wave settings.","For source changes, follow the repository JDK/Gradle requirements rather than assuming a preinstalled Java version.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Build a production chain that sustains a specified resource rate before a fixed wave.","Change a block or unit rule and verify loading, construction and client/server behavior.","Measure resource waste, survival and goal completion on a fixed custom map.","AI 使用与评估条件","A useful source-accessible test bed for planning and code changes. Retain license records for extracted assets, maps and plugins rather than inferring unrestricted dataset use from the free download.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98],"evidence",{"_58":103,"_25":104},{"_58":101,"_25":102},{"_58":99,"_25":100},"Repository license","https://github.com/Anuken/Mindustry/blob/master/LICENSE","Official source, server and build guidance","https://github.com/Anuken/Mindustry","Author download and pricing","https://anuke.itch.io/mindustry","查看许可条款",[108],"licenseUrl",{"_58":105,"_25":100},"许可类别","代码与资产采用不同许可","terms","provenance","资产许可","Check repository and bundled third-party notices for the selected release; no blanket CC0 asset grant is asserted here.","assetLicense","代码许可","GPLv3; retain notices for dependencies and distributed modifications.","codeLicense","开始使用",[122],"access",{"_58":123,"_25":104,"_124":125},"Free author download","note","The author itch.io page permits a zero-price download. The Steam edition is paid; free source access does not mean every storefront release is free.","主要来源",[129],"sourceUrl",{"_58":126,"_25":102},"技术栈","Java / Gradle / factory and tower defense","stack",